    "chunk_text": "Leofan men, we secga\u00f0 nu \u00e6rest on \u00feisum gewritum, \u00fe\u00e6t twegen cyningas w\u00e6ron, gecweden on leden An w\u00e6s se Chaldeisca, \u00fee acwealde godes folc on Iudea lande for heora geleafleaste, \u00fea \u00fea hi wur\u00f0odon \u00d0a tow\u00e6nde se cyning heora winsuman burh, Hierusalem gehaten, and \u00fe\u00e6t halige templ, \u00f0e Salomon Hundeseofontig geara hi wunedon \u00fe\u00e6r on \u00feeowte, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Cyrus cyning hi as\u00e6nde eft ongean to Iudea Nu w\u00e6s se o\u00fe\u00e6r cyning, \u00fee w\u00e6s gehaten on leden Nabochodonosor, on Syrian lande, \u00fe\u00e6s Cyres sunu, Hw\u00e6t, \u00fea Cambisus gecw\u00e6\u00f0 to gefeohte ongean Arfaxath, \u00fe\u00e6ra Meda cyning, and he hine ofsloh and Ac ealle \u00fea leodscipas anmodlice him wi\u00f0cw\u00e6don and as\u00e6ndon his \u00e6rendracan eft sona ongean butan \u00d0a gebealh se cyning Nabochodonosor hine sylfne and swor \u00feurh his cynestol, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde gewrecan He gegaderode his witan \u00f0a and wi\u00f0 hi ealle r\u00e6dde, cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t him swa \u00feuhte, \u00fe\u00e6t he sylf wolde ealne \u00dea sende se cyning sumne heretogan, Holofernem gehaten, mid mycelre fyrdinge and bebead him \u00feas \u00d0a ferde Holofernis mid orm\u00e6tre fyrde, swa swa se cyning bead, and tobr\u00e6c \u00e6lce burh and \u00fea ofsloh, Hundtwelftig \u00feusenda wigendra manna w\u00e6ron on his fyrdinge and twelf \u00feusenda scyttena symle him And nan folc ne mihte his fyrde wi",
